dsh-theme-endfield compatibility (src/shared/endfield.ts, src/client/endfield-dom.ts)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Written against the public behaviour and variable names of dsh-theme-endfield
(https://github.com/ymh0000123/dsh-theme-endfield, MIT). No source is copied; the plugin is read at runtime
(its stylesheet selectors) and left unmodified.
